.TH QUIPU-SHAPES 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-shapes \- Load, list or remove the SHACL shapes that guard writes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu shapes\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load, list or remove the SHACL shapes that guard writes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-shapes\-list(1)
List the loaded SHACL shapes
.TP
quipu\-shapes\-load(1)
Load a named SHACL shapes file; later writes are validated against it
.TP
quipu\-shapes\-remove(1)
Remove a named shapes file
.TP
quipu\-shapes\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
